Acknowledgements
----------------

This integration is a rewrite. It succeeds the custom component
TheMicDiet/chihiros-led-control (https://github.com/TheMicDiet/chihiros-led-control,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 michael) and keeps its domain (chihiros) and its
unique IDs, so existing installations can switch over. Do not install both at the
same time.

The following parts are based on that project's documentation and model registry
(no source files were copied; the code was written anew):

- the Bluetooth protocol description (docs/protocol.md: frame layout, checksum,
  LED, dosing pump and fan commands, notifications), which that project derived
  from the "My Chihiros" app 2.8.59 and Bluetooth captures,
- the model table in custom_components/chihiros/models.py (Bluetooth name
  prefixes, channel layouts, SeaLed/BleLed curve encoding, Lite controllers
  without weekday selection, Commander 1 layout choice),
- the WRGB VIVID III fan commands and status notification.

